    <string name="ui_view_readme">View README &amp; License (full text)</string>
    <string name="ui_readme_full">SikkatuCAD - mobile CAD drawing text editor and viewer for Android. Works with DXF and DWG drawings.

FEATURES
- Open and view DXF / DWG construction drawings (facades, plans, sections);
- Translate text labels (TEXT / MTEXT / ATTRIB) between any languages: export texts to JSON, translate, import back into the drawing;
- Save edited drawings as DXF (reliable) or DWG (experimental);
- Measurements: distance, angle, area; auto-dimensioning;
- Geometry editing: line, rectangle, circle, arc, polyline, text;
- Layer control, PNG view export.

PRIVACY
The app does not send anything to the internet. All drawing operations run locally on the device. You can verify this - the full source code is on GitHub.

LICENSE
Source-available: you may read, build and use freely (including commercially), but no forks, no modifications, no redistribution of modified versions. The name Sikkatu / SikkatuCAD and the cone logo may not be used for derivative products. Full text: LICENSE.md in the repository.

Links:
GitHub: https://github.com/sikkatu/SikkatuCAD
Telegram channel: https://t.me/sikkatu
Telegram chat: https://t.me/sikkatuCAD</string>
